Package: linux-image-4.9.190-acer-t482l
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for Acer One 8 T482L
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Acer One 8 T482L device.
 .
 Note: This package only ships the kernel image and modules, you should probably
 look at the linux-bootimage-4.9.190-acer-t482l package for a bootimage suitable
 for Android boot loaders.

Package: linux-bootimage-4.9.190-acer-t482l
