Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         linux-image-4.9.190-acer-t482l (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Linux kernel for Acer One 8 T482L - Android Boot Image
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Acer One 8 T482L device.
 .
 Note: This package ships an Android Boot Image bundled with Halium's
 initramfs.

